        </li>
        <li class="glass">
          <p class="label"><span class="o-node o-node--person" aria-hidden="true"></span>Step 9, review</p>
          <p class="title">Reads a one-page summary and approves the new vendor in minutes.</p>
        </li>
      </ol>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

